				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Food, Potions and Recovery"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0EA291FB12A81BF8", "62C5BCF193D3D64F"]
			description: [
				"A full enchanting setup uses fifteen accessible bookshelves with one block of air between shelf and table. Easy Magic keeps items in place while you compare options."
				"Enchantment Descriptions explains unfamiliar effects. Read conflicts and intended use before spending levels on the highest-looking number."
				"Keep lapis, books and grindstone access together so the enchanting room supports a complete decision loop."
				"Prepare for an encounter by identifying damage types, terrain, escape routes, food, healing, and equipment durability. A spare shield and blocks often matter more than a marginally stronger weapon."
				"Once the method works, label its inputs, outputs, controls, route, or habitat in plain language and show one teammate. Shared documentation turns a completed quest into knowledge that remains useful when the original player is offline."
			]
			id: "14B4AF82F4F94860"
			rewards: [{
				id: "11984E47A3CC1D07"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 15
			}]
			subtitle: "Build the library, then read the choices"
			tasks: [{
