		{
			dependencies: ["0F5172DEB8AF7C69"]
			description: [
				"When someone dies, stop generating new danger. Mark the location, identify the cause and assemble food, blocks, light and expendable equipment before returning."
				"One prepared escort is usually better than the whole team arriving separately. Secure the area before sorting the recovered inventory."
				"After recovery, repair the route or change the plan. Repeating the same death at higher speed is not persistence."
				"Use Corpse recovery as a second expedition: mark the death, take replacement food and gear, clear threats, and recover methodically. Do not feed repeated deaths into an unrecovered inventory out of frustration."
			]
			id: "79A388CAEFD02CF8"
			rewards: [{
