			y: -1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["003DB0959789CCC3"]
			description: [
				"Stock labelled sets for corpse recovery, Nether fire, underwater work and ordinary cave rescue. Use replaceable equipment and write what each kit is for."
				"Keep rare personal gear elsewhere so emergency supplies remain safe to borrow. Restock after every use rather than discovering empty chests during the next crisis."
				"The field keepers called an armoury a room full of second chances. Make yours easy to understand at a sprint."
				"Use Corpse recovery as a second expedition: mark the death, take replacement food and gear, clear threats, and recover methodically. Do not feed repeated deaths into an unrecovered inventory out of frustration."
