		{
			dependencies: ["2E7DA81BED4CB811"]
			description: [
				"Complete a dangerous expedition in which the team prepares a loadout, communicates the trigger, retreats when needed and returns together."
				"Write one sign or book entry explaining the enemy or hazard for future players. Knowledge turns a one-time victory into permanent safety."
				"The guide does not graduate you for killing everything. It does so when you can choose which fights are worth beginning."
