		{
			description: [
				"Open the Curios interface from the inventory and identify the slots enabled by this pack. Hover each artifact or relic to confirm its valid slot, active effect, trigger, cooldown, and any keybind."
				"Equip one item at a time and test movement, combat, mining, or recovery in a safe area. Combining several unknown passives makes it difficult to tell which item caused a benefit, conflict, or visual effect."
				"Store alternatives by role rather than rarity: travel, building, underwater, cave, boss, and recovery kits. A situational curio is valuable when the team can find it before the situation begins."
			]
			id: "34627A5E51594599"
			rewards: [{
