		{
			dependencies: ["34627A5E51594599"]
			description: [
				"Artifacts are powerful uncraftable finds placed in particular structure chests, archaeology, rare equipped mobs, and underground campsite encounters. A Mimic can replace a campsite chest and always rewards an artifact when defeated."
				"Approach unfamiliar underground chests with space to retreat. Record where each artifact was found because different loot sources encourage varied exploration rather than one universal farming route."
				"Read the effect and equip it in the correct Curios slot before judging it. Trade duplicates so different players can develop distinctive field roles instead of locking every discovery in one private collection."
			]
			id: "0EBAC814DB0A1DA5"
			rewards: [{
