		{
			dependencies: ["0EBAC814DB0A1DA5"]
			description: [
				"Relics have more complex behaviours and randomised qualities than ordinary equipment. Read the entire tooltip and identify the action the item is designed to perform before spending upgrades or comparing raw numbers."
				"Use the relic in controlled, repeatable situations and watch its progression. If experience does not move, verify that it is equipped, the trigger condition is met, and the action is not on cooldown."
				"Choose upgrades after learning the base behaviour, then document the resulting role. Two copies may not feel identical, so another player's recommendation is a clue rather than a guaranteed build."
			]
			id: "46C187D4CD38B0C4"
			rewards: [{
