		{
			dependencies: ["51F9F47AB21426BA"]
			description: [
				"When someone dies, record coordinates and dimension, identify the remaining threat, and wait long enough to assemble ordinary replacement gear. The corpse preserves items; it does not make the route safe."
				"Send one prepared recovery group with food, blocks, light, a spare way home, and empty storage. Clear enemies and secure the area before opening the corpse so recovered items do not spill into another death."
				"Return borrowed recovery gear and restock the kit immediately. Write down what caused the loss, because repeated unexamined deaths are a systems problem rather than proof that the pack is unfair."
			]
			id: "24163048752A605F"
			rewards: [{
