		{
			dependencies: ["24163048752A605F"]
			description: [
				"Build labelled sections for basic armour, shields and bows, food and potions, Curios, recovery supplies, and encounter-specific equipment. Keep museum originals separate from items intended for borrowing."
				"Add written loadout suggestions for a dungeon, underwater trip, Ancient City, boss, and corpse recovery. Explain purpose and return location instead of declaring one universal best set."
				"Ask another player to prepare for a chosen expedition without voice instructions or private storage access. The armoury is complete when they can assemble, understand, and later return a safe loadout from the information in the room."
